  "title": "Xbox Nano Controller Pivots to Cloud Gaming with Direct Wi-Fi Connection",
  "summary": "Microsoft is making its new Xbox Nano controller official today, allowing users to connect directly to Xbox Cloud Gaming over Wi-Fi for improved latency, while also introducing new ways to control cloud games using a phone. Amazon and Microsoft are pivoting their cloud gaming strategies to target different players with new features.",
